{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "四期生の松本和子(まつもとわこ)です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "開いてくださり、ありがとうございます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob3mo8iJ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobMM4qTz.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "少し前にはなりますが、\nサクコイカレシイベントありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "初めてだったので少し緊張もしたのですが、皆さんのおかげでとーっても楽しかったです✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ほんと楽しすぎて、ずっとずっと続いて欲しかった"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "制服を着て皆さんの前に立つのは初、？\n意外とレアだったのではないでしょうか"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob2vK8f8.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "前日に、カラオケへ歌の練習をしに行きました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "客観的な意見も欲しいなと思って、春さんについてきてと頼んだら来てくれて！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "春さんも手作りプレゼントを作っている最中だったのに、カラオケで作るよって言ってくれて、ほんとになんていい人なんだ！と思いました！！やさしい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobgiTFXa.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日はおまわりさんの日らしいですよ🫡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね"}], "source": "official"}